# 🕵️ ScrapeCreators Content Intelligence & Resilient Mock Pipeline

## 1. Context & Architectural Challenge
When assimilating social media research capabilities (`ScrapeCreators/social-media-research-skills`) into autonomous multi-agent systems:
1. **Unpredictable Tool Invocations by LLMs**: Autonomous agents frequently pass raw URLs (`https://tiktok.com/@creator/video/123`) without supplying explicit platform enums (`platform="TIKTOK"`), causing strict Pydantic models to fail with `ValidationError: Field required`.
2. **Third-Party API Outages & Token Exhaustion**: Scraping APIs are subject to network flakiness, rate limits, or absent API keys in local development/CI environments. Unhandled API failures cause agent loops and 90/90 tool budget exhaustion.
3. **Swarm Coordinator Routing**: Dedicated research agents (`gerych_researcher`) must seamlessly route domain actions (`comment_mining`, `ad_library_teardown`, `outlier_posts`, `transcript_intelligence`) to high-speed deterministic engines rather than executing slow web scrapers sequentially.

